Origin
------
Sentinel started from the initial idea of YS Guardian, built at Yambo Studio
(v1.0, October 2025: five QC checks, render presets, a few scene tools and the
snapshot system). Sentinel has since been extended far beyond that starting
point by Javier Melgar: the modular QC engine and eight of its thirteen checks,
project rulesets, baseline and gates, the web panel, Asset Hub, Sentinel
Frame, Pin and Variants, Matwire, Material Graph, the delivery manifest, the
in-Cinema 4D snapshot conversion and review slate, and the installer.

